//! owners, and they are drawn here small, in white on the brand's own colour,
//! for one purpose: telling a user which network or bank an item of theirs
//! belongs to, as the design does. Nothing here implies endorsement.
//!
//! Not every name the design lists exists in the project today: Mir, Maestro,
//! UnionPay, Citi, ING and Santander were removed from it, so those six have no
//! path here and are drawn as the design's text tiles.

